Uh-oh. It's a combination lock.

18:29.184 --> 18:31.520
Looks like I'm just gonna
have to cut through it.

18:31.687 --> 18:35.274
Good thing I brought
Reese Witherspoon's chin.

18:39.112 --> 18:41.531
<i>This
programming brought to you in part...</i>

18:41.698 --> 18:42.740
<i>...by Kobe Brand condoms.</i>

18:42.907 --> 18:45.911
<i>The protection you want
for the sex she doesn't.</i>

18:46.078 --> 18:47.746
Brian, do you know where Peter is?

18:47.913 --> 18:50.582
Yeah, he and the guys went
to go rob your dad.

18:50.749 --> 18:52.209
I believe you.

18:58.633 --> 19:00.301
I'm in.

19:09.186 --> 19:11.355
Holy crap, there's another door.

19:11.522 --> 19:12.523
What do we do now?

19:12.690 --> 19:14.567
<i>Welcome to the vault.</i>

19:14.734 --> 19:16.235
<i>Voice identification, please?</i>

19:16.485 --> 19:17.946
Uh-oh.

19:18.280 --> 19:20.407
It's me, Carter. I want my money.

19:20.574 --> 19:22.492
<i>Voice print verified.</i>

19:24.244 --> 19:25.620
How the hell do you do that?

19:25.787 --> 19:27.414
I can do you guys too.

19:27.581 --> 19:28.623
Hey, everybody.

19:28.790 --> 19:30.626
- Oh, hey, Peter.
- No, it's still me.

19:30.793 --> 19:32.253
Oh.

19:34.547 --> 19:36.132
<i>Welcome to the inner vault.</i>

19:36.299 --> 19:38.676
<i>Penile identification required.</i>

19:38.843 --> 19:40.762
Let me handle this.

19:44.850 --> 19:46.602
That's amazing.
How did you match it?

19:47.019 --> 19:50.355
Oh, I didn't match the shape.
I just stuck it in there and broke it.

19:54.110 --> 19:55.403
<i>Final checkpoint.</i>

19:55.570 --> 19:57.363
<i>Answer this question:</i>

19:57.530 --> 19:59.908
<i>What is the most
unattractive male first name...</i>

20:00.074 --> 20:02.620
<i>...in the English language?</i>

20:03.746 --> 20:04.830
Keith.

20:09.126 --> 20:10.920
Wow, look at this place.

20:11.086 --> 20:13.715
There's more dough in here
than a Swedish bakery.

20:13.882 --> 20:15.342
Look at all my dough.

20:15.509 --> 20:17.010
I'm covered in dough.

20:17.177 --> 20:19.638
Father, you're covered in dough.

20:19.804 --> 20:22.432
Oh, you spoiled the surprise.

20:22.599 --> 20:25.353
I'm making you a cake out of dough.

20:28.898 --> 20:31.275
All right. Pack up the dough
and get out of there.

20:31.442 --> 20:32.568
Joe, stop.

20:32.735 --> 20:36.365
- Lois, what are you doing here?
- I'm here to talk some sense into you.

20:36.531 --> 20:38.200
Do you wanna go through with this?

20:38.367 --> 20:40.494
I have to, Lois, for my family.

20:40.661 --> 20:43.205
I don't know where else
to get $20,000.

20:43.372 --> 20:45.249
But you know Daddy will find out.

20:45.415 --> 20:47.210
He'll put his best people on the job.

20:47.377 --> 20:50.755
- And believe me, he'll catch you.
- That's a risk I'm willing to take.

20:50.922 --> 20:53.341
But think about
your beautiful little girl.

20:53.508 --> 20:55.677
You can't watch her grow up
from jail.

20:55.843 --> 20:59.223
You'll miss running after her
as she learns to walk.

20:59.390 --> 21:02.309
I mean, riding bikes with her as she...

21:02.476 --> 21:04.645
I mean, dancing at her wedding.

21:04.812 --> 21:07.440
Look, my point is,
you know what you're doing is wrong.

21:07.607 --> 21:09.526
And you know how to make it right.

21:11.861 --> 21:14.948
Guys, put the money back
and get out of there.

21:15.115 --> 21:16.950
<i>What? Are you out of your mind?</i>

21:17.117 --> 21:20.037
- Tell him, Megatron.
- Do as I command!

21:20.204 --> 21:21.956
<i>Okay, okay, jeez.</i>

21:26.752 --> 21:28.337
So how'd Susie like your video?

21:28.504 --> 21:30.173
I don't care about her anymore.

21:30.340 --> 21:32.300
I'm in love with Bryan Adams.

21:32.467 --> 21:36.221
Peter, I want you to promise me you'll
never do anything that stupid again.

21:36.388 --> 21:39.558
Lois, after what you did for Joe,
I'll promise you anything.

21:39.725 --> 21:42.353
How did you get your dad
to give him that 20 grand?

21:42.520 --> 21:43.896
I told him it was for me.

21:44.063 --> 21:46.482
I said I wanted to hire
a divorce lawyer.

21:48.151 --> 21:52.031
Yeah, right.
You're joking about that, right?

21:52.823 --> 21:54.366
Lois?

21:54.533 --> 21:56.243
You're joking, right?

21:56.577 --> 21:57.786
Lois.

21:57.995 --> 21:59.705
Ah, ha-ha.

21:59.706 --> 23:00.706
Thank you for watching «Family Guy» on
www.FOX-fan.ru